Package: LifespanInequalityMultistate
Title: Threshold Age of Lifespan Inequality in a Multistate (Healthy-Disabled) Framework
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Phanidhar", "Upadhyaya", email = "Phanidhar.u@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reproducible code for a multistate (Healthy-Disabled-Dead) extension
    of the single-state threshold-age condition for lifespan inequality. Implements
    a discretised product-integral over age-varying Gompertz-type transition
    intensities, computes multistate survival, lifespan entropy, and the threshold
    age a* solving the eq. (30) condition, and reproduces all figures and tables
    in the associated manuscript. This is a research-compendium DESCRIPTION file
    (not a package on CRAN); it exists to document dependencies precisely.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.2)
